[279.132847, "o", "                                 deployment. This is ignored if deploying to a\r\n                                 production deployment.\r\n  --preview-name <name>          The name to associate with this preview\r\n                                 deployment. Defaults to the current Git branch\r\n                                 name in Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages and\r\n                                 GitHub CI. Reuses the existing deployment if\r\n                                 one exists.\r\n  --preview-create <name>        Like --preview-name, but deletes and recreates\r\n                                 an existing preview deployment with the same\r\n                                 name. This parameter can only be used with a\r\n                                 preview deploy key (when used with another type\r\n                                 of key, the command will return an error).\r\n  --env-file <envFile>           Path to a custom file of environment variables,\r\n                                 for choosing the deployment, e.g.\r\n                                 CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT or CONVEX_SELF_HOSTED_URL.\r\n                                 Same format as .env.local or .env files, and\r\n                                 overrides them.\r\n  --message <message>            Optional message to attach to this deployment\r\n                                 in the audit log.\r\n  -h, --help                     display help for command\r\n"]
